    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: Repeatedly pair tissue states or actions with prespecified rewards or punishments, then test on held-out conditions whether morphology or expression shifts toward a rewarded target more than yoked and unpaired controls.";
